---
layout: base.njk
title: Privacy Policy | Ridgeway Rentals
description: Read the Ridgeway Rentals privacy policy to learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information when you request or book a trailer rental.
---
<section class="section section-full section-hero-header interior" data-reveal-group>
  <div class="container-interior" data-reveal>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: {% year %}</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-full" data-reveal-group>
  <div class="container-interior legal-content" data-reveal>

    <p>
      Ridgeway Rentals ("we", "us", or "our") respects your privacy and is committed to
      protecting the personal information you share with us when you request a quote,
      book a trailer, or otherwise contact us through {{ site.url }}.
    </p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
    <p>
      When you submit a booking request or contact form, we may collect your name, email
      address, phone number, delivery address, and details about your rental request
      (such as drop-off/pick-up dates and what you plan to dispose of).
    </p>
    <p> 
      If you choose to receive marketing communications from us, we may also collect and 
      retain a record of your marketing consent, including the communication method or 
      methods you selected.
    </p>

    <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <p>
      We use the information you provide to confirm trailer availability, schedule delivery
      and pickup, respond to your inquiries, and communicate with you about your booking.
    </p>
    <p> 
      If you provide express consent to receive marketing communications, we may also use 
      your contact information to send you occasional communications from Ridgeway Rentals, 
      including promotions, special offers, disposal services, and company updates, using 
      the communication method or methods you selected.
    </p>
    <p> 
      We do not sell your personal information to third parties.
    </p>

    <h2>Marketing Communications</h2> 
    
    <p> 
      Marketing communications are optional. Providing an email address for a booking 
      request or other inquiry does not, by itself, mean that you have agreed to 
      receive marketing communications from us. 
    </p> 
    <p> 
      If you choose to receive marketing communications by email, we may send you occasional 
      commercial electronic messages about Ridgeway Rentals, including promotions,
      special offers, disposal services, and company updates.
    </p>
    <p>
      If you choose to receive marketing communications by text message, we may send you 
      occasional commercial text messages about Ridgeway Rentals, including promotions, 
      special offers, disposal services, and company updates. 
    </p> 
    <p> 
      You may withdraw your consent to marketing communications at any time. Marketing 
      emails will include an unsubscribe mechanism. For text messages, you can withdraw 
      consent using the unsubscribe instructions provided in the message or by contacting 
      us directly.
    </p>

    <h2>Sharing Your Information</h2>
    <p>
      We may share your information with staff or contractors involved in fulfilling your 
      rental or responding to your inquiry, and with service providers that help us operate 
      our website, process form submissions, provide communications services, or manage 
      marketing communications. These service providers may process information on our 
      behalf for the purposes described in this Privacy Policy. We may also disclose 
      information when required or permitted by law. We do not sell your personal 
      information or share it with third parties for their own marketing purposes.
    </p>

    <h2>Data Retention</h2>
    <p>
      We retain booking and contact information only as long as necessary to fulfill your
      request, maintain business records, and comply with legal obligations.
    </p>
    <p> 
      Where you have provided consent to receive marketing communications, we may 
      retain a record of that consent for as long as necessary to demonstrate and 
      manage your consent and comply with applicable legal requirements.
    </p>

    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>
      You may request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal information
      at any time by contacting us using the details below.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>
      If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at
      <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a> or
      <a href="tel:{{ site.phone | replace('-', '') }}">{{ site.phone }}</a>.
    </p>

  </div>
</section>
